[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2015\u2015\u307E\u3063\u305F\u304F\u3002\u3044\u304D\u306A\u308A\u30A2\u30C8\u30EA\u30A8\u3092\u98DB\u3073\u51FA\u3057\u305F\u6642\u306F\n\u4F55\u4E8B\u304B\u3068\u601D\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Honestly... When you suddenly ran out of the atelier like that,\nI was quite worried."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3046\u3002\u305D\u308C\u306B\u3064\u3044\u3066\u306F\u3054\u3081\u3093\u306A\u3055\u3044\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh... I\u0027m really sorry about that..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC\u306E\u5B9F\u529B\u306F\u8A8D\u3081\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u304C\u3001\n\u305D\u308C\u3067\u3082\u4E00\u4EBA\u3067\u6226\u3046\u306A\u3093\u3066\u3001\u7121\u8336\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3082\u306E\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even though I acknowledge your abilities,\nfighting alone like that was still reckless."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u304C\u3064\u3044\u3066\u3044\u306A\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3089\u3001\u3069\u3046\u306A\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305F\u304B\u3002\n\u3057\u3063\u304B\u308A\u53CD\u7701\u3057\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3001\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Who knows what might have happened if I hadn\u0027t been there.\nYou need to reflect on this properly, Sophie."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3046\u3063\u3002\u3055\u3063\u304D\u307E\u3067\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF\u3082\n\u7D0D\u5F97\u3057\u3066\u304F\u308C\u3066\u305F\u611F\u3058\u3060\u3063\u305F\u306E\u306B\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Aww... But you seemed fine with everything\njust a moment ago!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u8003\u3048\u306B\u5171\u611F\u3057\u305F\u3001\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3060\u3051\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\u305D\u308C\u3068\u3053\u308C\u3068\u306F\u8A71\u304C\u9055\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I merely sympathized with your thinking.\nThat\u0027s a different matter entirely."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3001\u305D\u3046\u3060\u3088\u306D\u2026\u2026\u3002\n\u7121\u8336\u306A\u3053\u3068\u3057\u3061\u3083\u3063\u3066\u3054\u3081\u3093\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-yeah, you\u0027re right...\nI\u0027m sorry for being so reckless!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3075\u3002\u307E\u3041\u3001\u8AAC\u6559\u306F\u3053\u306E\u304F\u3089\u3044\u3067\u3002\n\u30C1\u30E7\u30B3\u4F5C\u308A\u306B\u96C6\u4E2D\u3057\u3066\u3044\u304D\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe. Well, that\u0027s enough lecturing.\nShall we focus on making chocolate?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3093\u3001\u9811\u5F35\u308B\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah, I\u0027ll do my best!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u306A\u3093\u3066\u3044\u3046\u304B\u3055\u3002\n\u3053\u3093\u306A\u6C17\u6301\u3061\u3001\u306F\u3058\u3081\u3066\u304B\u3082",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You know... This feeling...\nI think it might be my first time experiencing it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30F3\u30C7\u796D\u306E\u3053\u3068\u306F\u3001\u524D\u304B\u3089\u77E5\u3063\u3066\u305F\u3057\u3002\n\u3069\u3046\u3044\u3046\u7531\u6765\u304C\u3042\u308B\u306E\u304B\u3082\u5206\u304B\u3063\u3066\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027ve always known about the Linde Festival.\nI even knew about its origins."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u3001\u304A\u796D\u308A\u306E\u610F\u5473\u3068\u304B\u3001\u8FBC\u3081\u308B\u3079\u304D\u60F3\u3044\u3068\u304B\u3001\n\u305D\u3046\u3044\u3046\u306E\u306B\u3001\u6B63\u9762\u304B\u3089\u5411\u304D\u5408\u3063\u305F\u306E\u306F\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But really facing the meaning of the festival,\nand the feelings we should put into it..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ECA\u56DE\u304C\u521D\u3081\u3066\u3001\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3059\u306D\u3002\n\u79C1\u3082\u540C\u3058\u3067\u3059\u3088\u3001\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This is your first time truly engaging with it, isn\u0027t it?\nI feel the same way, Sophie."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3082\u5927\u5207\u306A\u3053\u3068\u3092\u3001\n\u307E\u305F\uFF11\u3064\u3001\u624B\u306B\u5165\u308C\u3089\u308C\u305F\u6C17\u304C\u3057\u307E\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I feel like we\u0027ve both learned something important\nas alchemists today."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3093\uFF01\u3000\u3042\u305F\u3057\u3082\u6210\u9577\u3067\u304D\u305F\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah! I definitely grew from this!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3068\u306F\u4E8C\u4EBA\u3067\u3001\u7F8E\u5473\u3057\u3044\u30C1\u30E7\u30B3\u3092\u8D08\u308A\u5408\u3046\u3060\u3051\u3002\n\u5B8C\u6210\u3059\u308B\u307E\u3067\u3088\u308D\u3057\u304F\u306D\u3001\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now we just need to exchange delicious chocolates.\nLet\u0027s do our best until they\u0027re done, Plachta!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3048\u3002\u3053\u3061\u3089\u3053\u305D\u3001\u3088\u308D\u3057\u304F\u304A\u9858\u3044\u3057\u307E\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, I look forward to working with you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2015\u2015\u3067\u3063\u304D\u305F\uFF5E\uFF01\u3000\u30C1\u30E7\u30B3\u3001\u5B8C\u6210\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s doooone! The chocolate is finished!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u75B2\u308C\u3055\u307E\u3067\u3057\u305F\u3001\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC\u3002\n\u3067\u306F\u65E9\u901F\u4EA4\u63DB\u3057\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well done, Sophie.\nShall we exchange them now?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u3063\u3068\u3001\u305D\u306E\u524D\u306B\u3002\n\u5C11\u3057\u5F85\u3063\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3048\u307E\u3059\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, but before that.\nCould you wait a moment?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3093\uFF1F\u3000\u3044\u3044\u3051\u3069\u3001\u3069\u3046\u3057\u305F\u306E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hm? Sure, but what\u0027s up?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ECA\u65E5\u3001\u79C1\u304C\u4F5C\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305F\u7BB1\u304C\u3042\u3063\u305F\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002\n\u3042\u306E\u7BB1\u306B\u5165\u308C\u3066\u6E21\u3057\u305F\u3044\u306A\u3068",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Remember that box I was making today?\nI\u0027d like to put it in there before giving it to you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3063\uFF01\u3000\u305D\u3046\u3044\u3048\u3070\u4F5C\u3063\u3066\u305F\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah! That\u0027s right, you were working on that!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u308C\u3082\u79C1\u306A\u308A\u306E\u3001\u60F3\u3044\u3092\u4F1D\u3048\u308B\u65B9\u6CD5\u306E\uFF11\u3064\u306A\u306E\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\u7D30\u3084\u304B\u306A\u5FC3\u9063\u3044\u3082\u3001\u5FC5\u8981\u306A\u3053\u3068\u3060\u3068\u601D\u3063\u305F\u306E\u3067",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s my way of conveying my feelings.\nI thought these little thoughtful touches were important too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\uFF01\u3000\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3042\u306E\u6642\u3001\n\u624B\u639B\u304B\u308A\u306F\u76EE\u306E\u524D\u306B\u3042\u308B\u3063\u3066\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah! So that\u0027s what you meant when you said\nthe hint was right in front of me...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306A\u3089\u3042\u305F\u3057\u3082\u4F5C\u308A\u305F\u3044\u306A\uFF01\n\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF\u3001\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u5F85\u3063\u3066\u3066\u304F\u308C\u308B\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then I want to make one too!\nCould you wait a bit, Plachta!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3075\u3075\u3002\u3086\u3063\u304F\u308A\u3067\u3044\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehehe. Take your time."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\uFF01\u3000\u3042\u3001\u305D\u308C\u3068\u3055\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thanks! Oh, and also!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30F3\u30C7\u796D\u306E\u672C\u756A\u306E\u65E5\u306B\u3001\n\u307E\u305F\u4E00\u7DD2\u306B\u8857\u306B\u51FA\u3066\u3001\u30C1\u30E7\u30B3\u3092\u98DF\u3079\u306B\u884C\u304B\u306A\u3044\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "On the day of the Linde Festival,\nwant to go into town together and try some chocolate?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3044\u3067\u3059\u306D\u3002\n\u305C\u3072\u4E00\u7DD2\u306B\u56DE\u308A\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That sounds lovely.\nLet\u0027s definitely do that!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3078\u3078\u3001\u3046\u3093\uFF01\n\u697D\u3057\u307F\u3060\u306A\u3041\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, yeah!\nI can\u0027t wait!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]